  "description": "🚀 Nexx32Lib is a high-performance byte scanning library designed for fast and efficient pattern matching in large data streams. Whether you are searching for hex sequences, signatures, or patterns, Nexx32Lib delivers lightning-fast results with minimal performance overhead.\n\n⚡ Key Features:\n✅ Ultra-fast byte sequence search  \n✅ Optimized for performance and efficiency  \n✅ Supports wildcards and flexible matching  \n✅ Works with large data buffers and files  \n\nLet me know if you want any modifications! 🔥",
